PLACEHOLDER — not a real .brain file.

This file is a placeholder for the pre-trained base brain. It will be
replaced by a real .brain file (magic "TBRN", trained on a few MB of clean
Chinese text) before the first release. The app checks the magic bytes and
shows "base brain not provided yet" if this placeholder is still here.

占位文件——不是真正的大脑。首版发布前会被替换为预训练好的 .brain
（魔数 "TBRN"，用几 MB 干净中文语料训出的底座）。应用会检查魔数，
如果是占位文件，会提示“底座大脑尚未提供”。
